#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:1
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:3
msgid "产品定位"
msgstr "Product overview"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:6
msgid ""
"**面向无公网或固定区域作业的轻量化 RTK 定位套件。** D20 LoRa 移动站集成四臂螺"
"旋天线、定位计算单元与 LoRa 通信链路，并与配套 D13 LoRa 基站组成现场差分系"
"统。"
msgstr ""
"**A lightweight RTK GNSS base-and-rover kit for fixed-area operations "
"without public network access.** The D20 LoRa rover integrates a quadrifilar "
"helix antenna (QHA), positioning engine, and LoRa correction link, and works "
"with the included D13 LoRa base station to form an on-site correction system."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:9
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 四臂螺旋天线一体化 RTK 移动站"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa Integrated RTK GNSS Rover with Quadrifilar Helix Antenna"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:14
msgid "核心价值"
msgstr "Key benefits"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:16
msgid "**不依赖公网**：基站与移动站通过本地 LoRa 链路传输差分数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Independent of public networks**: The base station and rover exchange "
"correction data over a local LoRa link."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:17
msgid "**轻量移动端**：D20 移动站仅 38.2 g，适合无人机和紧凑型移动平台。"
msgstr ""
"**Lightweight rover**: The 38.2 g D20 is well suited to UAVs and compact "
"mobile platforms."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:18
msgid "**开箱完成配对**：基站和移动站出厂默认配对，上电自动连接。"
msgstr ""
"**Pre-paired for immediate use**: The base station and rover connect "
"automatically at power-on."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:19
msgid ""
"**支持多移动站**：一个局部场景使用一个基站，可一对一或一对多连接移动站。"
msgstr ""
"**Supports multiple rovers**: One base station can serve one or multiple "
"rovers within a local operating area."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:21
msgid "工作方式"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:23
msgid ""
"![HM-D20-LoRa与D13基站组成差分系统](../images/scenarios/d20-lora-ref-v2.png)"
msgstr ""
"![HM-D20-LoRa and D13 base station forming an RTK correction system](../"
"images/scenarios/d20-lora-ref-v2.png)"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:23
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa与D13基站组成差分系统"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa and D13 base station form an RTK correction system"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:25
msgid ""
"D13 基站固定接收卫星信号并通过内部 LoRa 链路发送差分数据，D20 移动站完成 RTK "
"解算，再通过 8-pin 接口向下游设备输出 NMEA 或 UBX 数据。"
msgstr ""
"The D13 base station receives satellite signals continuously and sends "
"correction data via an internal LoRa link, while the D20 rover completes RTK "
"solution computation and then outputs NMEA or UBX data to downstream devices "
"through an 8-pin interface."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:27
msgid "交付组成"
msgstr "Package contents"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:29
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 移动站。"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa rover."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:30
msgid "配套专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件及基站附件。"
msgstr "Dedicated D13 LoRa base station hardware and base station accessories."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:31
msgid ""
"移动站配套 8-pin 连接线缆、外置 LoRa 天线和兼容 3.3 V UART I/O 的 USB 转 "
"UART 转接器。"
msgstr ""
"The rover includes an 8-pin cable, an external LoRa antenna, and a USB-to-"
"UART adapter compatible with 3.3 V UART I/O."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:32
msgid ""
"基站配套外置 LoRa 天线和封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆；安装配件以装箱清单为准。"
msgstr ""
"The base station includes an external LoRa antenna and a sealed 4-pin USB "
"cable. Refer to the packing list for mounting accessories."

