msgid "外部接口"
msgstr "Interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:62
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 底部接口实物图"
msgstr "Photo of the HM-D20-LoRa bottom interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:62
msgid "HM-D20-LoRa 底部接口"
msgstr "HM-D20-LoRa bottom interfaces"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:65
msgid ""
"**D20 移动站 8-pin GH1.25 mm**：供电、3.3 V UART、3.3 V PPS 和磁力计 SCL/SDA "
"信号。"
msgstr ""
"**D20 rover 8-pin GH1.25 mm**: Power, 3.3 V UART, 3.3 V PPS, and "
"magnetometer SCL/SDA signals."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:66
msgid "**D20 移动站 SMA**：连接外置 LoRa 天线。"
msgstr "**D20 Rover SMA**: Connects to an external LoRa antenna."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:67
msgid ""
"**D13 基站 USB 线缆**：对外仅使用封装好的 4-pin USB 线缆；连接 USB 电源可直接"
"供电，连接电脑时可进行 USB 串口通信。"
msgstr ""
"**D13 base-station USB cable**: The sealed 4-pin USB cable is the only "
"external cable. Connect it to a USB power source for power, or to a computer "
"for power and serial communication."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:68
msgid "**D13 基站通信天线接口**：连接基站外置 LoRa 天线。"
msgstr ""
"**D13 base-station communication antenna connector**: Connect the external "
"LoRa antenna."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:71
msgid ""
"8-pin 接线安全 接线前必须查看[完整 8-pin 线束定义](../../rtk/operation/d20-"
"wiring.md)。设备只允许使用 5 V ±0.5 V 供电；正负极反接、使用错误电压或将电源"
"正极接到 TX/RX 等信号线均可能损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"8-pin wiring safety: Before wiring, check the [complete 8-pin pinout](../../"
"rtk/operation/d20-wiring.md). Power the device only from 5 V ±0.5 V. "
"Reversed polarity, an incorrect supply voltage, or connecting the positive "
"supply lead to TX/RX or another signal pin may damage the device."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:74
msgid "适用场景与前提"
msgstr "Applications and requirements"

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:76
msgid "适合固定区域内的无人机、园区机器人、农机和临时测量作业。"
msgstr ""
"Suitable for UAVs, site robots, agricultural machinery, and temporary "
"surveys within a fixed area."

#: ../../source/products/models/hm-d20-lora.md:79
msgid ""
"LoRa 现场边界 基站应在开阔位置稳定架设，**上电后不得移动**；同一局部场景只使"
"用一个基站。"
msgstr ""
"LoRa operating requirement: Install the base station securely with an open "
"sky view and **do not move it after power-on**. Use only one base station in "
"the local operating area."

